    "q-75812": {
      "dom_id": "step-q75812",
      "name": "Question 4",
      "problem": "$\\frac{7}{2}\\times 3÷\\frac{1}{4}=$",
      "worked_solution": "To evaluate this expression, we use PEMDAS.\n\nWe multiply and divide, from left to right:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{7}{2}\\times 3÷\\frac{1}{4} & = \\\\ (\\frac{7}{2}\\times 3)÷\\frac{1}{4} & = \\\\ (\\frac{7}{2}\\times \\frac{3}{1})÷\\frac{1}{4} & = \\\\ \\frac{7\\times 3}{2\\times 1}÷\\frac{1}{4} & = \\\\ \\frac{21}{2}÷\\frac{1}{4} & = \\\\ \\frac{21}{2}\\times \\frac{4}{1} & = \\\\ \\frac{21\\times 4}{2\\times 1} & = \\\\ \\frac{84}{2} & = \\\\ 42\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
